where each i is a different experiment, which I would like to pool.  I write 
the splus equation as

        lme( Y ~ X + Z, data=pooled, random=~ X + Z |  Experiment)

I get the following warning.

====================================
Warning messages:
    ITERATION LIMIT REACHED WITHOUT OTHER CONVERGENCE in: ms( ~  -
        logLik(lmeSt, lmePars), start = list(lmePars = c(coef(lmeSt))),  ....
