>   your formula supplied in the end to the NLS function, there is no dependence
>   on Delta. You will need to ensure that this dependence is made explicit
>   by defining Lamda's (and A) as functions of Delta. Otherwise, the NLS function
>   will treat your secondary definitions (lamdas and A) as being fixed
>   quantities, and will be unable to detect any parameter to
>   vary.
